cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "sc-audit: an operational audit framework for low-expression genes in case-control single-cell studies"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.8.4
date-released: 2026-10-12
abstract: >-
  Detection-floor, control-composition (including an identifiability layer with a
  prespecified matching ladder), robust-signal and cell-identity audits for
  case-control single-cell/single-nucleus studies, with all thresholds fixed
  before analysis.
authors:
